Per CC-BY-SA 4.0 §3.b, modifications relative to the original arc42
templates are limited to compaction (only the first help block of
each chapter is reproduced) and the addition of auto-generated
content under a separately marked "Derived from source code" /
"Aus dem Quellcode abgeleitet" sub-section. The chapter ordering,
titles and help-text wording are reproduced verbatim.
